WEBVTT

00:05:57.765 --> 00:06:01.055
A broken and haunted
person began that journey,

00:06:01.079 --> 00:06:03.988
but the person who emerged was a survivor

00:06:04.012 --> 00:06:06.262
and would ultimately grow into the person

00:06:06.286 --> 00:06:08.386
I was destined to be.

00:06:08.410 --> 00:06:11.074
Many people have harmed me in my life,

00:06:11.098 --> 00:06:12.568
and I remember them all,

00:06:12.592 --> 00:06:15.369
but the memories grow pale and faint

00:06:15.393 --> 00:06:19.061
in comparison with the people
who've helped me.

00:06:19.085 --> 00:06:21.681
The fellow survivors,
the fellow voice-hearers,

00:06:21.705 --> 00:06:23.953
the comrades and collaborators;

00:06:23.977 --> 00:06:26.281
the mother who never gave up on me,

00:06:26.305 --> 00:06:28.889
who knew that one day
I would come back to her

00:06:28.913 --> 00:06:32.559
and was willing to wait for me
for as long as it took;